+Generic mode Confirm now retains the authored transition to native flag placement. The placed pose registers the matching world/game draft without starting it. The registration remains alive while waiting, including indefinitely with one player; Start and Leave callbacks carry the game identity and are processed on the client tick. Deathrace retains that registration while editing its route. Saving a complete route returns to waiting; even a saved course goes through native flag placement and explicit waiting Start. Cancel, Quit and replacement of the start flag retire the previous registration before reopening. The obsolete direct setup-start callbacks have been removed.
